; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">) 10:00 ~ 17:00</font>, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">부산시청 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">층 대회의실<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">참가기업 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: Hitachi zosen, Denso, Toto, Kubota, Marubeni </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">등 일본 글로벌기업 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">30</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개사 내외<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">주최</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">/</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">주관 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">산업통상자원부</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">/KOTRA<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 4) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">행사내용 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">참가기업과 구직자간 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1:1 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">상담회 개최<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">사전 신청한 취업희망자 중 참가기업이 선정한 대상자와 현장면접 진행</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><br><strong>나</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>. </strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong>참가신청<br></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">신청방법 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">온라인 신청<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ㅇ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">행사사이트 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: <a href=\"http://abroad.contactkorea.go.kr/\"><strong><font color=\"#4169e1\"><u>http://abroad.contactkorea.go.kr</u></font></strong></a><br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ㅇ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">신청방법 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개인회원 가입 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">→ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이력서 작성 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">→ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">채용공고 지원 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">→ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">면접<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">서류 통과자에 한해 면접일정 전달 예정<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">신청기한 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: <strong><font color=\"#ff0000\">2013</font></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><font color=\"#ff0000\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">년 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">5</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">월 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">17</span></font></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong><font color=\"#ff0000\">일(금)<br></font></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp; <br><strong>다</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>. </strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong>참고사항<br></strong></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 